        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(telegram): time out incomplete Mini App auth bodies",
        "body": "Mini App 认证接口 (`/__openclaw_tg_miniapp/auth`) 只有 4 KiB 大小限制，没有读取超时。未认证客户端可持续发送不完整 body，占用请求处理资源。\n\n## 修复\n\n将手动逐 chunk 读取 body 替换为统一的 `readRequestBodyWithLimit`，复用 `WEBHOOK_BODY_READ_DEFAULTS.preAuth.timeoutMs` 超时策略：\n- 超时后由 SDK 层 abort 请求并抛出 `REQUEST_BODY_TIMEOUT` 错误\n- 路由层捕获后返回 408 Request body timeout\n- 与 payload-too-large (413) 分支对称\n\n## Proof\n\nReal vitest terminal transcript against exact commit head `75df44a44b`:\n\n```\n$ npx vitest run extensions/telegram/src/miniapp/routes.test.ts --reporter=verbose\n\n RUN  v4.1.10\n\n ✓ serves the page without resolving published URLs       94ms\n ✓ mints a control-ui bootstrap token for a valid owner     8ms\n ✓ rejects replayed init-data without minting again         2ms\n ✓ reserves validated init-data before minting              1ms\n ✓ rejects non-owner Mini App auth requests                 1ms\n ✓ rate-limits repeated auth requests by IP                 5ms\n ✓ times out incomplete Mini App auth request bodies        7ms\n\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  7 passed (7)\n Duration  10.39s\n```\n\nKey proof line: \"times out incomplete Mini App auth request bodies\" exercises the real production route handler with a Readable stream that never calls `read()`, asserts the handler settles with HTTP 408 and \"Request body timeout\" body, and verifies the connection is released rather than held open.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
